abstract: >-
  Analysis code for the bulk RNA-seq of sorted MHC II+ and MHC II- bone marrow
  megakaryocytes: differential expression, Gene Ontology enrichment,
  transcription factor activity, and integration with the Sun et al. (2021)
  single-cell megakaryocyte atlas (Fig 4A to 4E and Fig S5A to S5F), with the
  reference output of the tested run.
